NAME
       wc - count lines, words and bytes

SYNOPSIS
       wc [-clmw] [file ...]

DESCRIPTION
       Counts lines, words and bytes in each FILE, then prints a total
       when more than one file is given. With no FILE standard input is
       read. With no option all three counts are printed.

OPTIONS
       -c     count bytes
       -l     count newlines
       -m     count characters
       -w     count words

SEE ALSO
       cat(1), grep(1)
